Compare Inference Speed of Torch, Torch-jit-trace, OpenVINO
How much inference acceleration can be achieved by following this pipeline: .pth → ONNX → OpenVINO IR (.xml/.bin) → CPU compile_model → AsyncInferQueue?

I was asked that question by @gunianxue in my baseline topic. Then I tried comparing the inference speed of Torch, Torch-jit-trace, OpenVINO on 600 ogg files (it means 600 * 12 = 7200 waves).

As you know, how much the inference speed improves depends on the model architecture and the execution conditions.

I used a HGNetV2-B0 w/ LSE-Head architecture and ran the measuring notebook several times.
