The result shows us:

The inference speed varies significantly from run to run.
Torch-jit-trace is slightly faster than Torch.
OpenVINO is about twice faster than Torch.
However, it should be noted that the outputs of OpenVINO differ from those of Torch, and the scores may be slightly worse.
Therefore, it may be better to use Torch-jit-trace rather than OpenVINO if your models do not take so long time for execution.


